==Battleground==
*5 [[The Thrillerz|Thrillerz]] spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 8~10 seconds<sup>240f~300f</sup>.
*5 [[Mr. Angel]]s spawn after 8 seconds<sup>240f</sup>, delay 6.67~8 seconds<sup>200f~240f</sup>.
*1 [[Zir Zeal]] spawns after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.
*5 [[Squire Rel]]s spawn after 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>, delay 2~4 seconds<sup>60f~120f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Cruel Angel Clionel]] spawns as the boss.
**Infinite [[Squire Rel]]s spawn, delay 6.67~10 seconds<sup>200f~300f</sup>.
**5 [[Mr. Angel]]s spawn, delay 16.67~23.33 seconds<sup>500f~700f</sup>.
**3 [[Zir Zeal]]s spawn, delay 60~66.67 seconds<sup>1,800f~2,000f</sup>.
**10 [[The Thrillerz|Thrillerz]] spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 16.67~23.33 seconds<sup>500f~700f</sup>.
**1 [[Angelic Sleipnir]] spawns after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>.
**1 [[Dread Bore]] spawns after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Since [[Cruel Angel Clionel]] spawns on base hit and there are limited enemies, you can use that to build up your wallet, using double bounty units like [[Hip Hop Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Can Can Cat]] or [[Express Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Bullet Train Cat]] to maximize profit. Use [[Cat Cannon|Holy Blast]] when [[Zir Zeal]] digs down and at least bring one Zombie Killer like [[Wushu Cat (Rare Cat)|Shigong Cat]] or [[Teacher BearCat (Rare Cat)|Cadaver BearCat]].

When you hit the base, Clionel spawns with almost no support to protect her blindspot, with only the annoying Thrillerz delaying your units to the blindspot but are dealable to handle. Use rushers like Talented [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Awakened Bahamut]], [[Express Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Bullet Train]], and [[Crazed Cow Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Manic Lion]] to quickly kill Clionel and heavily chip down [[Angelic Sleipnir]] if you happen to not kill Clionel. Make sure that Bahamut hits the base so that the explosion hitbox can linger and damage Clionel. From there, it will be an easy victory.

